aHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          海拔：1200 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          批次：OSC-06\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧日晒 Anaerobic Natural\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：菠萝、橙子、草莓、花香\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Pineapple, Orange, Strawberry, Floral\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q36MicNiclTfcCUkjP6ZaWC6TuSBFdG4b00oOkHd97wB6V2VlSqkrnIaCSyJ16FV2GkicZCPWzhfT7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 840px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2JzibF9IAJkZArPVRvl2Uy0c2oHicbFfzSKYiaySSKPXbYejibWDvTdxQDg/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          图片来自cafeimports 棕榈树位于米纳斯州喜拉多区域，橘黄色区块\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于达特拉 Daterra\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1902年，一个来自意大利的家庭跳上了一艘开往巴西的船，开启了新生活的探险，最终来到了Campinas市落脚并种植咖啡来生活；1908年，家里较为年长的儿子在集市上开了一个咖啡摊，售卖咖啡豆并教导家庭主妇们如何烘烤咖啡，这是这个家族最早与咖啡结缘的经历。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          随后，小伙子娶了当地的一个女孩子组织了家庭，为了家庭生计和更好的生活，他们转型美食店、加油站，但夫妇两都较早的离世，家里的重担就落在了长子Donato身上，在很迷茫无助的时候，出现了一位Donato完全不认识的陌生人，提供了资助使得生活和生意得以维持，这个陌生人只说他认识他的父母，后代们回忆这段“传说”往事时，都觉得这就是家族认定的“信念、希望、团结、对人以尊重”的价值观的来源。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gUL3HGGKMadEzZQE9yv22ichq8xHCe5fOSicbe8Gm5lXhCjKO4jqibNXW1Ag/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一直到1976年，经历了多年的变革，家族才重新开启农业的投入，创立了达特拉庄园，Daterra的意思是“来自地球”，随后尝试了养牛、种植牛油果，然后再过渡到咖啡的种植。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          如今，达特拉有3个农场，分别是 Boa Vista、Taboues 和Franca，达特拉将种植地块细分为 1-5 公顷的区域为一个区块，每个区块委派一个专人的农艺师照料，整个庄园共有42位农艺师照顾着560个种植区块。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULFjib7icibIEeklAjib0B5okK2HzGM4s3fWuEac1YV28ibR6VmibSu5foarsA/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULFRsAticCf3vfgZEzVc6zl0hZib73WVLNTCib47hAibdiamtsRMVWs3hOHEQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          达特拉的咖啡分为3个系列，分别是\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULBYIDPjXVR1EIwiaZaVibgDI5zRbDdoKH6P76sKEfUYslcWwSS3oXTtXA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Classic - 达特拉 经典\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          达特拉的经典是“喜拉多”，这种全球很早就驰名的咖啡品类、品名的代表，在达特拉，单一品种或者是混合批次，由庄园的杯测师评分在80-86分的咖啡会被纳入Classic这一产品。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Collection - 达特拉 甄选\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          甄选洗礼，是达特拉的当前的精细的种植、加工处理的体现，它是达特拉每一产季豆单上庄园最“拿手”的产品，完全可追溯到品种、地块和所有的处理过程，评分在86-89分之间。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Masterpiece - 达特拉 杰作\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          没有翻译成大师，是因为它不仅仅是代表了庄园那些杰出的农艺师、杯测师们的努力和卓越，它更体现的是庄园所种植的这些咖啡品种的优异，所以是咖啡豆与人都极佳的表现和配合下最终才得以有这一系列的产品。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Masterpiece的每一个产品都是一个独有的创新尝试，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在每一产季在达特拉都是\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          独一无二的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          微批次，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          完全可追索所有的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          信息，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          评分在88分以上。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULB1ubeAHsvZmJibApqsWiatroic4kNIYT2RSe9MZmcZlmqkdm5OUicXgojQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULA8Z9ricjDWHrL2icVQskeftkvWc24yxPZTibeHlk7Q7bTsIBeic1nYC0IA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          基于在汽车制造业的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一些技术经验积累，达特拉的工程师们\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          革新改进了\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          加工处理的设备，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          水洗处理的设备可以根据咖啡果的不同成熟度\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          来调节脱皮用的水压，而日晒处理的浮选设备可以\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          根据\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          咖啡果的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          密度以及大小来\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          精细的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          筛选\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不同成熟度、颗粒大小的鲜果。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 388px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
